# Changes to the review check itself, and to the reference templates consumers copy, need a
# human who isn't the PR's own author -- the issue #61 "self-mutating required check" defense
# extended to this repo's own CI files and the examples it distributes.
/.github/workflows/      @pjpoulose
/.adversarial-review.yml @pjpoulose
/examples/trusted/       @pjpoulose
/action.yml              @pjpoulose
# This file has to own itself, or a contributor can edit CODEOWNERS to remove every rule above
# (including this one) without needing code-owner approval to do it.
/.github/CODEOWNERS      @pjpoulose
